src/github_actions/schema/*.yaml, src/github_actions/datamodel/ and
project/ model what GitHub's documentation says a workflow file, an
action's metadata file and a repository ruleset state. They are this
project's rendering, written in its own words with each page cited by
address; they are not GitHub's, and their use does not imply endorsement
by GitHub, Inc. GitHub's documentation is licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0):
https://github.com/github/docs/blob/main/LICENSE

SchemaStore's GitHub Actions schemas, by JSON Schema Store
-----------------------------------------------------------

src/github_actions/schema/schemastore/ holds a copy of two files from
JSON Schema Store, retrieved from
https://github.com/SchemaStore/schemastore/tree/f7c2f3bcb512651bd980ed6896639ea8ded9ddf0/src/schemas/json

  github-workflow.json  the schema of a GitHub Actions workflow file
  github-action.json    the schema of an action's metadata file

beside SchemaStore's own LICENSE and NOTICE, copied from the root of the
same commit. Every file is identical to its counterpart there, and
